[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0010","text":"——转身要再快一点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0020","text":"（真乃练得很投入啊。）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0030","text":"——……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0040","text":"真乃！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0050","text":"你没事吧！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0060","text":"是、是的……\n对不起，打断了练习……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0070","text":"没事，是因为练得太投入了嘛。\n不过，千万别勉强自己。疼不疼？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0080","text":"……没事的。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0090","text":"那就好……\n有什么情况立刻告诉我。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_02_0100","text":"（——希望没事……\n　先观察一下情况吧……）"}]
